    "Apple Intelligence runs on-device — free, private, offline. Other providers need an API key set in Settings → Flo." : {
      "comment" : "A footer explaining that Apple Intelligence is free and runs on-device, while other providers require an API key.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يعمل Apple Intelligence على الجهاز — مجانًا وبخصوصية ودون اتصال. تحتاج المزوّدات الأخرى إلى مفتاح API يُضبط في الإعدادات ← Flo."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence kører på enheden — gratis, privat, offline. Andre udbydere kræver en API-nøgle, der sættes i Indstillinger → Flo."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
