    "Apple system frameworks (HealthKit, CoreBluetooth, AVFoundation, Speech, MapKit, Core Location, CoreMotion, CryptoKit, Combine, SwiftUI, WatchConnectivity, BackgroundTasks, StoreKit) are governed by their respective Apple SDK licenses included with Xcode." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the open-source libraries used by Emuqu and their respective licensing.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تخضع أُطر نظام Apple (HealthKit وCoreBluetooth وAVFoundation وSpeech وMapKit وCore Location وCoreMotion وCryptoKit وCombine وSwiftUI وWatchConnectivity وBackgroundTasks وStoreKit) لتراخيص Apple SDK الخاصة بها والمضمّنة مع Xcode."
