    "DFA α1 stayed above 0.75 the whole way — pure aerobic-base territory, exactly what Z2 work targets." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing a workout where the user's DFA α1 value remained above 0.75 throughout the entire session, indicating they were in a pure aerobic-base state, which is typical for workouts that",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
