    "Reading too short — Frequency analysis needs ≥256 clean beats. The Time Domain tab still has the standard HRV metrics." : {
      "comment" : "A message displayed when the user's HRV reading is too short for the frequency domain analysis to be performed. It informs the user that they can still view the standard HRV metrics in the Time Domain tab.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "القراءة قصيرة جدًا — يحتاج تحليل التردد إلى 256 نبضة نظيفة على الأقل. لا تزال علامة تبويب المجال الزمني تعرض مقاييس HRV القياسية."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Målingen er for kort — frekvensanalyse kræver ≥256 rene slag. Fanen Tidsdomæne har stadig de standard HRV-mål."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Messung zu kurz — die Frequenzanalyse benötigt ≥256 saubere Schläge. Der Tab „Zeitbereich“ zeigt weiterhin die Standard-HRV-Werte."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lectura demasiado corta — el análisis de frecuencia necesita ≥256 latidos limpios. La pestaña de Dominio del Tiempo sigue mostrando las métricas HRV estándar."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mittaus liian lyhyt — taajuusanalyysi vaatii vähintään 256 puhdasta lyöntiä. Aikatason välilehdellä on yhä vakio-HRV-mittarit."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mesure trop courte — l’analyse fréquentielle nécessite ≥256 battements propres. L’onglet Domaine temporel affiche toujours les mesures HRV standard."
          }
        },
        "is" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mælingin er of stutt — tíðnigreining þarf ≥256 hrein slög. Tímasviðsflipinn hefur enn hefðbundnu HRV-mælingarnar."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lettura troppo breve — l’analisi in frequenza richiede ≥256 battiti puliti. La scheda Dominio del Tempo mostra comunque le metriche HRV standard."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "測定が短すぎます — 周波数解析には清浄な拍が 256 以上必要です。時間領域タブには標準の HRV 指標が表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "측정이 너무 짧습니다 — 주파수 분석에는 깨끗한 박동이 256개 이상 필요합니다. 시간 영역 탭에는 표준 HRV 지표가 여전히 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Målingen er for kort — frekvensanalyse krever ≥256 rene slag. Tidsdomene-fanen har fortsatt standard HRV-mål."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meting te kort — frequentieanalyse vereist ≥256 schone slagen. Het tabblad Tijddomein toont nog steeds de standaard HRV-metrieken."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
