    "Write HRV and heart-rate results back to the Health app." : {
      "comment" : "A hint that appears when toggling the \"Export to Apple Health\" switch in the \"Wearables & Apple Health Settings Page\". It explains that the app writes heart rate and HRV data to Apple Health automatically after",
