    "You slept more than your usual target — likely catching up on accumulated debt." : {
      "comment" : "Insight in the Sleep Detail view, highlighting that the user slept more than their usual target, possibly due to catching up on accumulated debt.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "نمت أكثر من هدفك المعتاد — على الأرجح تعوّض دَينًا متراكمًا."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du sov mere end dit sædvanlige mål — sandsynligvis indhentning af opsparet søvngæld."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast mehr als dein übliches Ziel geschlafen — wahrscheinlich holst du angesammelte Schlafschuld auf."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dormiste más que tu objetivo habitual — probablemente estés recuperando deuda acumulada."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nukuit tavanomaista tavoitettasi enemmän — todennäköisesti kuittaat kertynyttä univelkaa."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous avez dormi plus que votre objectif habituel — vous rattrapez sans doute une dette accumulée."
          }
        },
        "is" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Þú svafst meira en venjulegt markmið þitt — líklega að vinna upp uppsafnaða svefnskuld."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hai dormito più del tuo obiettivo abituale — probabilmente stai recuperando il debito accumulato."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "いつもの目標より長く眠りました — 蓄積した睡眠負債を返している可能性が高いです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "평소 목표보다 더 오래 잤습니다 — 누적된 수면 부채를 갚고 있을 가능성이 큽니다."
